<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In all situations, every frustration,</l><l>All your anxiety comes from Satan,</l><l>To disturb your life of living Christ.</l><l>Just stay in the union, living communion,</l><l>One with Christ; give everything to Him.</l><l>Peace of God through our life of living Christ.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
